# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
#
# `eol=lf` is not cosmetic here. Almost everything this repository tests is a
# byte-exact comparison — the compiler's golden snapshots, the IR hashes, the
# Luau rasters checked against Rust-generated goldens, and the committed Lucide
# modules that `check:lucide` regenerates and diffs. A CRLF checkout makes every
# one of those fail on Windows and nowhere else, so the working tree is LF on
# every platform, not just in the index.
* text=auto eol=lf
